<title>USA: Laclede to sell West Virgina operations.</title>
<headline>Laclede to sell West Virgina operations.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Laclede Steel Co said Monday it has agreed to sell the assets of its electrical weld structural and mechanical tubing operation in Benwood, West Virginia to  Excaliber Tubular Corp.</p>
<p>Cash proceeds form the sale, expected to be about $10 million, will be used to improve the steel manufacturer's working capital position, Laclede said.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close in a month, Laclede said. Excaliber is located in St. Louis.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
